# ─── Environment variables ────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values. On the hosting
# platform (Vercel) set the same keys in the project's environment
# variables — do NOT commit .env.local.
#
# The site currently needs no secrets to build or run. Befaring requests
# from /estimat POST to /api/lead, which logs them to the server. When you
# wire that route up to a real destination (Resend / SendGrid email, a
# Slack webhook, or a CRM), add its credentials here.
#
# Example, once email delivery is added:
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# LEAD_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=post@finthjem.no
